@startuml psm-process
title AWS PSM Modeling Process (11 Phases)
start
:Phase 0 — Account & Stage Strategy;
:Phase 1 — Stack Scaffolding;
:Phase 2 — Security Baseline;
:Phase 3 — Networking;
:Phase 4 — Identity;
:Phase 5 — Durable Storage;
:Phase 6 — Messaging;
:Phase 7 — Event Fabric;
:Phase 8 — Compute;
:Phase 9 — API Gateway;
:Phase 10 — Workflow & Observability;
:Phase 11 — Integration Views & Readiness;
if (PSM EVL pass?) then (yes)
  :M2T generation gate;
  stop
else (no)
  :Refine resources;
  backward :Phase 11;
endif
@enduml
